          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te nkitoria e Ahasero te nkiterunoto e nkitoria enye, neiger ninche enkitang'oroto te nkaraki lelo oo manya Yuda o Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa too nkolong'i e Artaserses, o Bishlam o Mitredat, o Tabeel o lkulikae le ncholuek enye, neigeroki empalai Artaserser olaiguanani le Parsia. Eigeroki apa ina palai te nkutuk e Aramea neibelekenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Rehum olkitok le njore o Shimshai ilo aigeroni neiger empalai te nkaraki Yerusalem aigeroki Artaserses ilo aiguanani nejo nji ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki Rehum ilo kitok le njore aiger, o Shimshai ilo aigeroni, o lelo kulikae le ncholuek enye, o larishak, o lbalusuni, o lkituaak, o le Parsia, o ltung'ana le Erek, o le Babilon, o ltung'ana le Susa, aa taa ile Elam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenebo ilkulikae oreren laa ninche etimirayie olkitok oji Osnapar nepuo aamany nkanas e Samaria, o kulie lo lkerenket otii idia alo olkeju, naa ore taata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ena entashati eina palai apa nairriwaitie ninche - “Enetii Artaserses olaiguanani: Ore isinkan linono, lelo tung'ana lo lkerenket otii teidia alo olkeju, kirriu enkirorokino. Ore taata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchoo eyiolou olaiguanani nchere, ore ilapa Yahudi ooetuo eing'ua enitii, nepuonu enikitii neshomo Yerusalem. Enyaakita aashet enapa anasa kiserut e ntorroni; eidipa ninche isunta neramita ilkitamanyunot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo naa taata eyiolou olaiguanani nchere, teneigili aashet ena anasa neidipayu isunta, meitoki ninche aalak kodi; anaa mpisai olpolosie anaa ine nkoitoi, ore mpisai enkitoria nengoroo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa enkaraki naa iyie kingarakino, nemeishiaakino iyiook nikiduaaki olaiguanani esulare, enkaraki ena pee kirriwakita olaiguanani olkilikuai aaitayiolo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee itum aing'oru enjurrunoto tiatua embuku oo mbaa oo loo papaai lino. Itum iyie tiatua embuku oo mbaa, niyiolou nchere ore ena anasa naa aikiserut, naa enkaitooshoni too laiguanak, o too lkerenketi, netipikaki apa ninye enking'oling'ol ebaiki moitie, enkaraki ena apa pee eitaaki ena anasa olmuaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kintayiolo iyiook olaiguanani nchere, teneigili aashet ena anasa neidipayu isunta enyena, nimintoki aata enipor ilo kerenket otii lido kekun olkeju.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa olaiguanani ewalata ejo: “Enetii Rehum ilo kitok le njore o Shimshai olaigeroni o lkulikae pooki le ncholuek enye ootii Samaria otii olkerenket teidia alo olkeju, airriu enkirorokino. Naa ore taata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enapa palai nirriwakita iyiook neisumaki aaibalie te dukuya nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aitayio nanu enkitanapata neitobiraki enjurrunoto, nenotoki nchere ore ena anasa ebaiki apa moitie netudumakine ilaiguanak agilunore, netii enkiser o enkarruoisho atua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa ilaiguanak magil Yerusalem, ooitoreishote to lkerenket pooki le lido kekun olkeju, laa ninche apa elaakini kodi o mpisai o lpolosie, o mpisai oo nkoitoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina entobira pee elikini kulo tung'ana metapala esiaai, nemeitoki aashet ena anasa, ometaba anaa naitobir enkitanapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa entodol pee mintololong'ong'o ena bae; kainyoo pee eibulaa enkinyalata pee einyal ilaiguanak?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eisumi entashati e mpalai o laiguanani Artaserser te dukuya Rehum o Shimshai olaigeroni o lelo le ncholuek enye, neisarrisar aapuo enetii Ilyahudi te Yerusalem ore te nkisikong'ata o te ngolon neitapal ninche esiaai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyaaka esiaai e nkaji e Nkai aiteru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
